#
msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "Link Teams"
msgstr "Teams verbinden"

msgid "Receive approvals on Microsoft Teams and decide right there"
msgstr "Freigaben auf Microsoft Teams erhalten und dort entscheiden"

msgid "Connect Teams"
msgstr "Teams verbinden"

msgid ""
"The Azure Bot registration's App ID and password. Never leaves the secret "
"store unencrypted."
msgstr ""
"App-ID und Passwort der Azure-Bot-Registrierung. Verlässt den Secret Store "
"nie unverschlüsselt."

msgid "Save & test"
msgstr "Speichern & testen"

msgid "Bot registration"
msgstr "Bot-Registrierung"

msgid "The Azure Bot resource's App ID, password, and (optional) tenant ID."
msgstr "App-ID, Passwort und (optionale) Tenant-ID der Azure-Bot-Ressource."

msgid "Microsoft App ID"
msgstr "Microsoft-App-ID"

msgid "From the Azure Bot resource's registration, a GUID."
msgstr "Aus der Registrierung der Azure-Bot-Ressource, eine GUID."

msgid "App password"
msgstr "App-Passwort"

msgid "The client secret generated for the Bot resource's app registration."
msgstr "Das Client-Secret der App-Registrierung der Bot-Ressource."

msgid "Tenant ID (optional)"
msgstr "Tenant-ID (optional)"

msgid ""
"Only for a single-tenant App registration. Leave empty for the default "
"multi-tenant Bot Framework login."
msgstr ""
"Nur für eine Single-Tenant-App-Registrierung. Für den Standard-Multi-"
"Tenant-Login von Bot Framework leer lassen."

msgid "Highest allowed confidentiality"
msgstr "Höchste erlaubte Vertraulichkeit"

msgid ""
"How sensitive may the messages this channel actually displays be (approval "
"details, assistant replies)? With \"public\", only a heads-up that something"
" is waiting arrives -- the content itself stays in oc8."
msgstr ""
"Wie sensibel dürfen Nachrichten sein, die dieser Kanal tatsächlich anzeigt "
"(Approval-Details, Assistant-Antworten)? Bei \"public\" kommt nur ein "
"Hinweis an, dass etwas wartet -- der Inhalt selbst bleibt in oc8."
